{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b0111c12-1ff8-86e5-b824-fc318c224706",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T12:11:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sarah Singh",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:08:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:08:22-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hi. I'm calling about trash pickup. They missed us again, and that's the second time in a row. Last week and now today. Um, sorry, hang on. Max, not now, I'm on the phone. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:08:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries. Let me grab some details. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:08:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "157 Broadway, in the North End. The bins were out at the curb by seven this morning, I checked, and they're still sitting there full."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:08:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 157 Broadway, missed pickup, second one in a row. Did you put out anything last week that might've been left behind, or just the regular bins?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:08:56-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the regular ones, both times. The trash and the recycling. Well, last week it was just the trash, and this week it's both. I don't know if, um, [pause] Lily, put that down please. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:09:08-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're all set, take your time. I'll put in a report for today's miss and flag that it's a repeat for that address. Is the cart sitting where the truck can reach it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:09:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, right at the end of the driveway, lid closed, nothing blocking it. Same spot as always."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:09:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Anything else I can note?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:09:28-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, actually, one more thing. We have an old dryer in the garage that has to go. Do you haul appliances, or is that something I arrange separately? I didn't want to just stick it out on the curb and get a notice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:09:42-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good call not putting it out. Large appliances usually aren't taken with the regular pickup. They typically need a separate pickup scheduled, and sometimes there's a step if it has a cooling system, but a dryer shouldn't. I can send a note to the crew supervisor to call you with how to set it up. Is this a good number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:10:01-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the number you're seeing should be it, but it's 401-555-0180 just in case. Our internet's been down, so my neighbor lent me a hotspot for the day, otherwise I'd have looked it up online. That's why I'm calling instead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:10:14-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0180. So I've got missed pickup today at 157 Broadway, second in a row, and a request for a callback on hauling a dryer. Is mornings or afternoons better for the callback?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:10:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoons, after, um, [pause] after one or so. Max, I said not now. Sorry, after one is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:10:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After one it is. Should I tell them to leave the bins out for the truck to come back, or do you want to bring them in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:10:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Should I leave them out? I mean, will somebody come back today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:10:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't promise today, but leave them out in case they circle back. If they don't, the supervisor can tell you more when they call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:10:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Fine. Thank you. That's everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:10:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for calling, Sarah. Take care."
    }
  ],
